# Generate m18 L18A b05 break reset v2 scene asset

## Goal

Generate one corrected course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-18-lesson18A/m18_L18A_b05_break-reset.png`.

## Scope

- Replace the office-stretching version with a calm yoga/reset scene.
- Use the supplied BMH course doodle references and Priya anchor.
- Keep Priya as the same BMH representative: black back ponytail, orange/yellow headband, orange headset with boom mic, yellow top, cream pants, orange shoes, white or cream face and hands, dot eyes, subtle cast-board nose, and simple friendly mouth.
- Show exactly one full-body Priya centered on a simple yoga mat.
- Include at most one small water bottle near the mat.
- Keep a clean cornflower-blue background with open space for Remotion labels.
- Use only flat course colors: `#62B3F3`, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black.
- Avoid a desk, office stretching, extra people, text, numbers, logos, decorative doodles, motion marks, clutter, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, perspective, and clipped subject.

## Verification

- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
- Confirm the file is a PNG at 1600 x 900.
- Visually inspect for one full-body Priya, yoga/reset mat composition, no desk, no extra people, no text, no decorative filler, and enough blue open space.
- Confirm palette is normalized to the locked flat course colors.

