+# Generate m18 L18A b04 first call block v2 scene asset
+
+## Goal
+
+Generate one corrected Lesson 18A b04 course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-18-lesson18A/m18_L18A_b04_first-call-block-v2.png`.
+
+## Scope
+
+- Use the supplied BMH course doodle references and Priya anchor.
+- Make one 3x3 grid montage on a blue canvas with nine equal rounded panels.
+- Show the same Priya/BMH representative in every panel with headset, yellow top, cream pants, orange shoes, white or cream face and hands, dot eyes, subtle cast-board nose, and simple friendly mouth.
+- Vary only the call posture or expression across the nine panels: listening, smiling, focused note-taking, asking a question, checking screen, dialing, thinking, confirming, and wrapping up.
+- Keep the locked flat palette and style: cornflower blue `#62B3F3`, yellow, orange, cream `#FFF7DE`, white, and black.
+- Avoid extra people, text, numbers, labels, captions, logos, readable screens, ambient doodles, decorative filler, gradients, texture, shading, shadows, perspective, and clipped subjects.
+
+## Verification
+
+- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
+- Confirm the file is a PNG at 1600 x 900.
+- Visually inspect for a nine-panel Priya calling-block montage, same identity in all panels, no extra people, no text, no decorative filler, and clean blue space.

